  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification encodes a deterministic, coverage-biased exploration policy: random_walk is used in clear/search states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery turns are used only when obstacles are detected. Recovery is conservative and minimal, with full_rotate reserved for deadlock. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state, and only one controllable is enabled per state.",
